      "datasource": null,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Scanner / Airwaves \u2014 Dormant\n\nThis dashboard is **dormant until the Uniden SDS200's network audio is streaming**; panels populate automatically once transmissions are transcribed into the `fire` / `rail` / `chp` / `scanner` / `atc` / `cb` beats.\n\nZero data here is expected \u2014 the airwaves light up the moment audio begins flowing."
      },
